{"schema_version":1,"id":"y2_winter_third_seal_dialogue","title":"第三枚封印","start_node":"start","characters":["hero","mira"],"nodes":[{"id":"start","type":"line","speaker":"mira","text":"石魔像把人們不願面對的回憶砌成鎧甲。擊敗它不是忘記過去，而是讓過去不再困住現在。","next":"answer"},{"id":"answer","type":"choice","options":[{"text":"我會帶回秋之封印。","next":"accept"},{"text":"讓我再聽一次先祖的歌。","next":"later"}]},{"id":"accept","type":"action","actions":[{"type":"quest","quest_id":"y2_winter_third_seal_quest","state":"active"}],"next":"end"},{"id":"later","type":"line","speaker":"mira","text":"它的最後一句，是『仍然向前』。","next":"end"},{"id":"end","type":"end"}]}
